From ab77c165096a600f9f7b0e57052d30e3fc4e6614 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 03:08:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: show CNFutures market labels instead of raw i18n keys
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

CN futures/options markets were added to the product but locale packs still
only covered the original markets. Indicator IDE add-watchlist tabs called
$t('dashboard.indicator.market.' + m) directly, so missing keys rendered as
dashboard.indicator.market.CNFutures. A production zh-CN hotfix sometimes
supplied 国内期货, which made the label look intermittent.

- Add CNFutures / CNFuturesOptions / CNIndexFutures / CNIndexOptions labels
  (and settings descriptions) across locale files
- Add resolveMarketLabel() with static zh/en fallbacks
- Use it for indicator IDE tabs, AI analysis, settings, and strategy IDE
